      244.17,
      350.17,
      358.17,
      361.24
    ],
    "text": "Excise Notification No. 981",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      227.13,
      375.06,
      375.21,
      385.02
    ],
    "text": "EXCISE DUTY ON MALT LIQUOR",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      398.17,
      547.35,
      421.24
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Sub-section (1) of Section 22 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52), as amended fromtime to time, I, Ravi Karunanayake, Minister of Finance do by this Order direct that, with effect from 05th December 2015 -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      80.73,
      434.17,
      547.14,
      469.24
    ],
    "text": "(1) There shall be imposed on Malt Liquor of less than Five per centum (5%) of absolute strength as indicated in thelabel, manufactured in and issued from any licensed brewery established in Sri Lanka, a duty at the rate ofRupees One Hundred and Ninety (Rs. 190.00) only on every litre so issued.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      80.73,
      482.17,
      547.13,
      517.24
    ],
    "text": "(2) There shall be imposed on Malt Liquor of Five per centum (5%) and above of absolute stength as indicated in thelabel, manufactured in and issued from any licensed brewery established in Sri Lanka, a duty at the rate of RupeesThree Hundred and Fifteen (Rs. 315.00) only on every litre so issued.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      78.57,
      530.17,
      547.31,
      565.24
    ],
    "text": "(3) The aforesaid duty shall not be levied or recovered on any quantity of such liquor which is issued from suchbrewery for the use of any Diplomatic Mission in Sri Lanka or any foreign country, if payment for such quantityof Liquor is made from the foreign account of such Diplomatic Mission ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      80.73,
      578.17,
      547.29,
      589.24
    ],
    "text": "(4) The Excise Notification, No. 980 published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1941/31 of 20.11.2015 is hereby rescinded.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      614.17,
      535.15,
      673.24
    ],
    "text": "RAVI KARUNANAYAKE,Minister of Finance.Ministry of Finance,Colombo 01,04th December 2015.",
